include Common.buildvars

Assembly %_FileName
.run | .

SourceDirectory           Samples
BuildDirectory            Build/Samples/%Mode
IntermediateDirectory     Intermediate/Samples

if windows Linker.Subsystem Windows

if no_object_stream SourceFiles.Exclude
[
    BigWorldTest.cpp
    KinematicRigTest.cpp
    LoadRigTest.cpp
    LoadSaveBinaryRigTest.cpp
    LoadSaveRigTest.cpp
    PoweredRigTest.cpp
    RigPileTest.cpp
    SkeletonMapperTest.cpp
]

Includes               . Build Samples TestFramework

Libraries              %_NativeLibs
Libraries:windows      D3D12 DXGI d3dcompiler dxguid dinput8
Libraries:linux        X11 Xrandr Xinerama Xcursor Xxf86vm Xext Xrender Xi

Linker.Flags:apple
[
    -framework Foundation
    -framework Cocoa
    -framework GameController
    -framework Metal
    -framework MetalKit
]

# TODO
# Frameworks                Foundation Cocoa GameController Metal MetalKit

if windows if mode == debug Libraries msvcrtd

Depends TestFramework/ | %_args
Depends Jolt/          | %_args

